* 1N4148, Nexperia SPICE model (assets.nexperia.com/documents/spice-model/1N4148.txt)
* Package pin 1 cathode, pin 2 anode. Extracted for PSPICE.
.SUBCKT 1N4148 1 2
R1 1 2 5.827E+9
D1 1 2 1N4148
.MODEL 1N4148 D
+ IS = 4.352E-9
+ N = 1.906
+ BV = 110
+ IBV = 0.0001
+ RS = 0.6458
+ CJO = 7.048E-13
+ VJ = 0.869
+ M = 0.03
+ FC = 0.5
+ TT = 3.48E-9
.ENDS
